# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}
    <p>{animal}</p>
{:else}
    {#if type === "dog"}no dogs{/if}
{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 {#each animals as animal}
     <p>{animal}</p>
 {:else}
-    {#if type === "dog"}no dogs{/if}
+    {#if type === "dog"}
+        no dogs
+    {/if}
 {/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}
    <p>{animal}</p>
{:else}
    {#if type === "dog"}
        no dogs
    {/if}
{/each}
```
